r-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Day Services<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_residential_living e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_residential_living elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/residential-living\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Residential Living<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_health_well_being e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_health_well_being elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/health-well-being\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Health &amp; Well Being<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_special_olympics e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_special_olympics elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/special-olympics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Engagement<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_content e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_content\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ov_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A full life includes places to explore, people to meet, and experiences to look forward to. At Good Shepherd Manor, community engagement begins with each man\u2019s interests. Whether he enjoys competing in sports, performing on stage, discovering nature, or sharing dinner with friends, we help him take part in activities that bring meaning and enjoyment to his life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ov_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1998\" height=\"1563\" src=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2260\" alt=\"Two men working on classroom activities in Community Day Services\" srcset=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg 1998w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-300x235.jpg 300w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1024x801.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-768x601.jpg 768w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1536x1202.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1998px) 100vw, 1998px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_1_cap elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_1_cap\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Placeholder photo \u2014 outings, athletics, and community events.<\/em><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_following-interests e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_following-interests\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"following-interests\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_following-interests_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_following-interests_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Following Interests, Finding New Favorites<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-following-interests_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"following-interests_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The men enjoy a wide variety of outings throughout Momence, the surrounding communities of Kankakee County and the Chicagoland area. A weekend might include cheering at a sporting event, catching a movie, attending a concert, or watching a local theater production. Dining out and shopping offer opportunities to make choices, practice everyday skills, and spend time together.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-following-interests_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"following-interests_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Other adventures take the men even farther from Momence such as exploring Fair Oaks Farms, visiting zoos and enjoying yacht trips on Lake Michigan. Celebrations, festivals, and local happenings offer new experiences alongside familiar favorites. Each outing creates opportunities to connect with others and participate in community life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_special-olympics e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_special-olympics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"special-olympics\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_special-olympics_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_special-olympics_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Teamwork, Confidence, and the Joy of Competition<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-special-olympics_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"special-olympics_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>More than 50 of our men compete in Special Olympics across more than 10 sports. Through practices and competitions athletes develop skills, build confidence, and form friendships with teammates and fellow competitors.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-special-olympics_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"special-olympics_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The experience extends beyond the competition itself. Working toward a personal goal, encouraging a teammate, and celebrating an accomplishment give the men opportunities to take pride in their efforts and share their enthusiasm with others.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_arts e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_arts\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"arts\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_arts_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_arts_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Creativity Takes Center Stage<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-arts_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"arts_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For men who enjoy the arts, participation in GSM\u2019s Chorus, or Easy Street Theater productions offer opportunities for creative expression, teamwork, and the excitement of performing for an audience. Attending other local productions, exploring art, and enjoying live music provide additional ways to enjoy personal interests.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-arts_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"arts_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Whether participating or applauding from the audience, the men are part of the creative life of their community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_outdoors e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_outdoors\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"outdoors\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_outdoors_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_outdoors_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Exploring the Outdoors<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-outdoors_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"outdoors_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Warmer months bring opportunities for picnics, park visits, farm outings, and outdoor events. Places such as Perry Farm, Island Park, the Kankakee River State Park, nature reserves and many other local parks offer settings for fresh air, time with friends, and the enjoyment of nature.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-outdoors_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"outdoors_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Some men look forward to an active excursion; others prefer a leisurely outing and a quiet place to take in their surroundings. A variety of experiences allows each man to enjoy the outdoors in ways that suit his interests and comfort.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_giving-back e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_giving-back\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"giving-back\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_giving-back_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_giving-back_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Belonging and Giving Back<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-giving-back_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"giving-back_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Community engagement also means contributing. Volunteering gives the men opportunities to share their abilities, help others, and take pride in their role within the community by giving back.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-giving-back_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"giving-back_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Attending community Mass and joining local celebrations strengthen connections with neighbors and offer meaningful ways to express faith and share traditions. Through these everyday encounters, the men build relationships and become familiar, valued members of the places they visit.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_gsm-events e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_gsm-events\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"gsm-events\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_gsm-events_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_gsm-events_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Welcoming the Community to GSM<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Connections grow in both directions. Along with participating in life beyond our campus, the men are involved in GSM events that welcome neighbors, families, and friends to the Manor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"gsm-events_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Fall Festival<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Held on the second Saturday of September, this annual tradition brings the GSM family and wider community together for a day of activities and celebration.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"gsm-events_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Annual Touch A Truck<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A free community event held the first weekend of October, offering opportunities for visitors of all ages and abilities to explore vehicles and meet the people who operate them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"gsm-events_5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Twelfth Night Bonfire<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A January gathering that brings people together to share a seasonal tradition.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"gsm-events_7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Free Outdoor Community Movies<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcoming opportunities to enjoy a movie outdoors and spend time together at GSM.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"gsm-events_9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These events offer more than a visit to our campus. They create opportunities to get to know the men, share experiences, and build lasting connections.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-gsm-events_10 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"gsm-events_10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/events\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Visit our Events page for upcoming dates and details. \u2192<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Residential Living Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. Divider Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. What We Offer We work alongside families, volunteers, and donors to make a meaningful difference in the daily lives of the men we serve. Learn More The Difference [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":0,"parent":317,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"disabled","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb